  <AltText>
    Artfight attack featuring 'Ayn el-Mal'ak from Project0Penumbra. Featured are 'Ayn el-Mal'ak, the Angel, Creamy the axolotl's dragon form, and Estrella, presumingly enjoying some tea. 'Ayn belongs to NijikawaSatoki (that's us), Creamy belongs to Project0Penumbra, and Estrella belongs to Blu_Barry. 'Ayn is a bibically accurate angel with many eyes that are red, green, blue, and purple. They also have white wings and is holding a red coffee cup. Estrella is an angel with off-white skin, white wings, and white hair. She is holding a blue coffee cup. Creamy is an axolotl. In their dragon form, they have brown skin/scales, very light yellow gills and fins, and is wearing a bluish-gray collar. They are holding a pink coffee cup.
  </AltText>
